Cinem AI Assistant Windows installer placeholder.

Drop the real NSIS build here as:

  public/downloads/Cinem-AI-Assistant-Setup.exe

Or set CINEM_AI_ASSISTANT_SETUP_URL / NEXT_PUBLIC_CINEM_AI_ASSISTANT_SETUP_URL
to a hosted copy of that filename.

See docs/cinem-ai-assistant.md. Do not commit a fake .exe.
